00395  81F0                        ; TMPFB HOLDS THE QUOTIENT (ROTATED IN VIA ASL/CARRY)
00396  81F0                        ; BUT WE MUST PUSH THE LAST COMPARISON BIT INTO TMPFB:
00397  81F0  2E 22 C0              ROL TMPFB           ; ROTATE FINAL CARRY INTO QUOTIENT
00398  81F3  2E 23 C0              ROL TMPFB+1
00399  81F6                        ; A = REMAINDER
